      "settlement": "Khazovar",
      "settlementKey": "khorvaak:Khazovar",
      "description": "Charley Whitechapel is a smooth, gender-less Golynn bartender whose polished courtesy covers a thriving side business in favors, contracts, and carefully deniable violence. They know who drinks diluted ichor, who buys the pure stuff, who is sleeping with a rival's bodyguard, and which threats can be solved by conversation before blades become expensive. Charley is never as harmless as their jokes, but their first loyalty is to the bar's balance of power, not to whoever shouts loudest from a balcony.",
      "settlementAndAncestryTexture": "Khazovar is a City in Khorvaak, under Scholar-Bureaucracy, with high danger, Beach and grass with water, Farming, Beach and reefs with water terrain. Local records favor Altruistic, Lawful, Cooperative, Honorable civic habits; common communities include Human, Halfling — Lightfoot Halfling, Halfling — Stout Halfling, Kender, Kithkin. Golynn reads through the Golynn entry of the race compendium, within Miscellaneous and Hard-to-Classify Races, marked by Nephthysra. Elegant, crystalline-featured beings associated with resonance, memory, and harmonic magic. They often serve as historians, performers, or arcane scholars. Table cues: Constitution +2, Strength +1, Natural Armour, Powerful Build; starting tendency Altruistic - Lawful - Cooperative - Honorable.",
      "rumors": [
        "Charley can arrange a beating, a warning, or a rescue with the same pleasant smile.",
        "Their house cordial is legal, but the back-room bottle list is written in code."
      ],
      "plotHooks": [
        "Charley offers the party a contract to remove a gang without letting the district know who paid.",
        "A patron dies after naming Charley as their emergency contact, and every faction wants the last message."
      ],
